WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:13.580
Cows can be best friends and experience stress
when they are removed from each other.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:22.400
In 1386 a pig in France was executed by public
hanging for the murder of a child.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:28.340
When Beethoven went deaf, he composed his
music by hacking the legs off his piano and

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:32.500
sitting on the floor so he could feel the
vibrations.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:38.190
French was the official language of England
for over 600 years.

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:42.120
Honey is the only food that never spoils.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:49.910
In New York city approximately 1,600 people
are bitten by other humans each year.

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:55.580
The colder the room is that you sleep in,
the more likely you are to have a bad dream.

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:59.470
Two-thirds of Africa is in the northern hemisphere.

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:05.470
Theoretically the Pope can resign but, since
he is the Supreme Pontiff, there is no one

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:08.980
qualified to accept his resignation.

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:12.440
Beaver's teeth never stop growing.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:18.910
The average speed of the wind has fallen by
60% in the last 30 years.

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:25.690
The average adult human has 1 to 4 kilogram's
of bacteria in his or her body.

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:31.880
You can see your nose at all times, your brain
just chooses to ignore it because it's not

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.090
important.

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:39.040
Bill Gates hacked into and tweaked his school's
computer programme's coding so that he was

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:42.820
placed in a class with mostly female students.

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:50.120
The last two speakers of the Mexican language
Zoque are both in their seventies and refuse

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:52.220
to speak to one another.

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:59.840
Almost any domestic cat can run faster than
Usain Bolt.

